放到这颗黑石子上！”唐小虾很是不解清元子的行为，但还是照做了，谁知他的食指一碰到那颗黑石子上，那石子上的黑色仿佛受到了什么冲击一般，纷纷化成粉末飞入了空中，露出里面白色的本来面目，而且这还不算完，那白色开始渐渐的变红，洛思琪和唐小虾都微微张大了嘴巴，直到那石头变成了沉血一样的暗红，上面的图案开始发出暗红色的光芒时，清元子才叫唐小虾把食指拿开。此时石碑上的青色光芒已经大盛了，照得整个石洞都明亮异常，清元子对唐小虾说：“你用右手打个响指看看！”惊奇的唐小虾照做了，他用右手轻轻的打了个响指，食指自然的伸出来指向了左边，他变得更惊奇了，因为他分明看见他右手的食指尖上，跳动起了小小的火焰！火焰在他的指尖上燃烧，包围了他食指上的指甲，可他一点都不觉得痛，只觉得上面有一股暖暖的感觉，他惊讶的问清元子：“这，这是什么？”清元子似乎也长出了一口气，给人一种如释重负的感觉，他对唐小虾说：“在漫长的整个时空之中，有多少恶念，便会有与其相反的善念，能蒙蔽这块石头的黑色恶念便是红莲所代表的仇恨，要想让这块石头变成红色，便需要与仇恨相反的关爱。”“你是说我身上有能祛除仇恨的关爱？”唐小虾似乎更加不解了，“从小到大我也就喜欢爱护什么猫猫狗狗的小动物而已，难道这就能祛除你所说的仇恨？”“当然没有那么简单了！”清元子笑着说：“关爱就是关心爱护，它可以慢慢的化解仇恨，却决不会一下子就改变人们仇恨的内心，这是一个很长的过程，就好比冲天的烈焰，也是由一个小小的火苗慢慢变成的。“那这石头是如何一下子就变成红色的？”洛思琪听唐小虾问道。纯真说：“红色石头只是七彩玲珑石上的一块而已，七彩玲珑石一共有七颗石头，颜色分别是赤、橙、黄、绿、青、蓝、紫，它们上面的黑色分别是仇恨、嫉妒、溺色、背叛、欺骗、贪婪、高傲。它们完全掩盖住七种善念时便是黑色的，不过它们其实与那七种善念有着相对应的属性，是那七种善念被腐蚀后变质而成的，也就是说它们不到极致的时候也会是这七种颜色，像你现在看到的暗红色，其实便是仇恨在被看得见时的颜色，不管哪种恶念被发挥到了极致，人便会失去自我，这时便成了黑色。你将你心灵中的那点关爱注入进去，所以这石头才会变成暗红，但这正如火种一样，现在还只是杯水车薪，要想完全发挥出七彩玲珑石的力量，便需要你们将其中的暗色祛除，让七颗石头都拥有它们自身最纯洁的颜色！”洛思琪听到这里便问了清元子两个问题，她问道：“可这七彩玲珑石究竟怎样才能都恢复成最纯洁的颜色？还有唐小虾指尖上的火焰是怎么回事？”唐小虾看着自己食指上的火焰也不解的看向清元子，希望他能够解答。两人听清元子说道：“要想让七彩玲珑石都恢复成最纯洁的颜色，自然需要与之对应的七种善念，与仇恨相对应的善念是关爱，现在，洛思琪，你把手指放在另一颗黑色石头上试试。”清元子指了指那暗红色石头旁的另一颗，洛思琪没想到自己也有份，便也把右手食指放上去。和刚才一样的情景，但不一样的是，这颗石头最后变成了暗橙色，洛思琪把手收回来，也想像唐小虾一样打个响指，她觉得指尖跳动起火苗的样子实在是太帅了。可她作为家长和老师心目中的乖乖女，以前是没学过打响指的，试了一次失败后，她便把求助的目光看向唐小虾，希望唐小虾能够教她。不料清元子却微微笑了起来，他对洛思琪摆了摆手说：“你和他不一样，他有火神的能力，你拥有的能力却是另一种。”说着他指着洛思琪的双手说：“你把双手摊开，并拢到一起。洛思琪照着做了，双手在中间形成了一个小小的凹陷，清元子继续说道：“你闭上眼睛，在心里想象着自己正捧着一捧清水。”洛思琪也照着做了，忽然觉得自己的手心里凉凉的，就像真捧着一捧水一样，她听到唐小虾的惊讶声，清元子对她说：“你现在睁开眼睛吧！”她看到了手中的真的出现了一捧清水，并且那水像吸附在了她的掌中一样，并没有从指缝中流出。这样的能力让洛思琪欣喜不已，她欢喜的问清元子：“我拥有产生水的能力，难道我是水神么？”她看见清元子摇了摇头，听他说道：“水神拥有的能力可以引起滔天巨浪，他就像龙一样，能兴云吐雾，能恩泽万民，这样的能力对你一个女孩子来说负担有些太重了。”清元子见洛思琪有些不解，继续说道：“你对水的操控并没有水神那么强，但你也可以控制少量的水，并且拥有一些水神所没有的能力。”他示意洛思琪道：“现在你手中已经有一些水了，你试着把它们想象成结冰的样子！”洛思琪按照清元子的指导凝神去想，她又一次惊奇的发现她手中的清水居然真的慢慢的凝结成冰了！这冰在洛思琦的掌中有些微凉，但比她之前拿过的冰要好上许多，以前她拿冰块的时候都是感到冷得几乎拿不住的，她听到清元子对自己说：“你和唐小虾一样对自己用法术产生的东西都有着抗性，这冰你捧着并不会觉得冷，但要别人来拿着的话，几乎立刻就要失手扔掉的！”他接着对洛思琪说：“你拥有的是月神的能力，能唤水成冰，不过现在还和唐小虾一样，都只有一些微弱的能力，看着吓人，可要与邪神和他的七大护法对抗，还差的远呢！”说完他便让洛思琪和唐小虾将自己的右手放在那散发着青色光芒的石碑上，两人的手瞬间被青色光芒所覆盖了，但这种覆盖只持续了几秒钟，两人的手便又恢复了原来的样子。清元子让两人将手拿开，对他们说：“这石碑叫心灵石碑，我刚才叫你们用七彩玲珑石激活了它，又用手将自己的心灵与其相通，只有激活了七彩玲珑石的你们和身为善念化身的我才拥有这种能力，你们这样做了，便相当于在这块心灵石碑上做了标记，以后你们无论在何处，只要再见到这种石碑，都能用你们的手掌将其激活。”“那将其激活又有什么用呢？”洛思琪看着面前散发着青色光芒的心灵石碑问道。清元子笑着说：“它的用处实在太大了，只要你们心存善念，无论你们当时的身心是多么的疲惫，只要将手放在上面，就会感到全身又充满了力量。”洛思琪听清元子这么一说，果然也感觉自己现在全身比刚才更加的有活力了，她看向唐小虾，从他的神情中也可以看出，他的感觉和自己是一样的。她听见清元子继续说道：“这神奇的石碑不光有消除疲劳的作用，你们在现代感觉最快的交通工具应该是飞机吧，它给你们所都带来的震撼，一定会比古人穿越到现代坐上飞机更强烈！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 Marks on the Soul Stele When Qing Yuanzi heard what Luo Siqi said, he couldn't help but stroke his beard and said with a smile: \"It's rare for you to observe so carefully.\" I saw him gently touching a black stone on the string of colorful stones to the top of the stone stele. As if there was a reaction at the tip, the light of the stone tablet suddenly became brighter. Qing Yuanzi turned to Tang Xiaoxia and said: \"Xiaoxia, put the index finger of your right hand on this black stone!\" Tang Xiaoxia was very puzzled by Qing Yuanzi's behavior. But he still did as he was told. Unexpectedly, as soon as his index finger touched the black stone, the black on the stone seemed to have been impacted by something, and turned into powder and flew into the air, revealing the true color of the white inside. And that was not over yet, the white began to gradually turn red. Both Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia opened their mouths slightly. Until the stone turned into dark red like blood, and the pattern on it began to glow dark red, Qing Yuanzi asked Tang Xiaoxia to take away his index finger. At this time, the blue light on the stone tablet was already strong, illuminating the entire cave. Qing Yuanzi said to Tang Xiaoxia: \"Snap your fingers with your right hand and see!\" Surprised Tang Xiaoxia did as he did. He lightly snapped his fingers with his right hand, and his index finger naturally stretched out and pointed to the left. He became even more surprised, because he clearly saw a small flame dancing on the tip of the index finger of his right hand! The flame burned on his fingertips and surrounded the nails on his index fingers, but he didn't feel any pain at all. He only felt a warm feeling on it. He asked Qing Yuanzi in surprise: \"What, what is this?\" Qing Yuanzi seemed to let out a sigh of relief, giving people a feeling of relief. , he said to Tang Xiaoxia: \"In the entire long time and space, as many evil thoughts as there are, there will be good thoughts that are opposite to them. The black evil thoughts that can blind this stone are the hatred represented by the red lotus. If you want this stone to turn red, you need the opposite of hatred.\" \"You are.\" \"You say that I have love that can eliminate hatred?\" Tang Xiaoxia seemed even more puzzled, \"Since I was a child, I have only loved caring for cats and dogs. Could this eliminate the hatred you are talking about?\" \"Of course it's not that simple!\" Qing Yuanzi said with a smile. Just care and love can slowly dissolve hatred, but it will never change people's hateful hearts at once. This is a long process, just like the flames rising into the sky, which also slowly turn from a small flame. \"Then how did this stone turn red all of a sudden? Luo Siqi heard Tang Xiaoxia ask. Innocence said: \"The red stone is just one piece of the colorful exquisite stone. There are seven stones in the colorful exquisite stone. The colors are red, orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue, and purple. The black on them are hatred, jealousy, lust, betrayal, deception, greed, and pride.\" They are black when they completely cover up the seven kinds of good thoughts, but they actually have corresponding attributes to those seven kinds of good thoughts. They are formed by the corrosion of those seven kinds of good thoughts. That is to say, they will also be these seven colors when they are not at their extreme. The dark red you see now is actually the color of hatred when it is visible. No matter which evil thought is brought to the extreme, people will lose themselves and become black. You inject that little bit of care in your heart, so this stone will turn dark red, but just like fire, it is only a drop in the bucket now. If you want to fully exert the power of the colorful exquisite stones, you need to remove the dark colors in them, so that the seven stones have their own purest color! \"When Luo Siqi heard this, she asked Qing Yuanzi two questions. She asked: \"But how can these colorful exquisite stones be restored to their purest colors? And what’s with the flames on Tang Xiaoxia’s fingertips? \"Tang Xiaoxia looked at the flames on his index finger and looked at Qing Yuanzi in confusion, hoping he could answer. The two heard Qing Yuanzi say: \"If you want to restore the colorful exquisite stones to their purest colors, you naturally need seven kinds of corresponding kind thoughts. The kind thoughts corresponding to hatred are care. Now, Luo Siqi, try putting your finger on another black stone. \"Qing Yuanzi pointed to the other one next to the dark red stone. Luo Siqi didn't expect that she was also involved, so she also put her right index finger on it. It was the same scene as before, but the difference was that the stone finally turned dark orange. Luo Siqi took her hand back and wanted to snap her fingers like Tang Xiaoxia. She felt that the flames dancing on her fingertips were really cool. . But as a good girl in the eyes of parents and teachers, she had never learned to snap her fingers before. After trying it once and failing, she turned to Tang Xiaoxia for help, hoping that Tang Xiaoxia could teach her. Unexpectedly, Qing Yuanzi smiled slightly, waved to Luo Siqi and said, \"You are different from him. He has the ability of the Vulcan, but you have another ability. Then he pointed to Luo Siqi's hands and said, \"Spread your hands and put them together.\" Luo Siqi followed suit, forming a small depression in the middle with her hands. Qing Yuanzi continued: \"Close your eyes and imagine in your mind that you are holding a handful of water.\" Luo Siqi also followed suit, and suddenly felt that the palms of her hands were cold, like It was like holding a handful of water. She heard Tang Xiaoxia's surprised voice, and Qing Yuanzi said to her: \"Open your eyes now!\" She saw a handful of clear water really appeared in her hand, and the water seemed to be absorbed in her palm and did not flow out from her fingers. This ability made Luo Siqi very happy. She asked Qing Yuanzi happily: \"I have the ability to produce water. Am I the water god?\" She saw Qing Yuanzi shake his head and heard him say: \"The water god has the ability to cause huge waves. He is like a dragon, can stir up clouds and spit mist, and can benefit all people. Such an ability is burdensome for a girl like you.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}